/users/guest-twenty-one/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guest-twenty-one/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guest-twenty-one/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guest-twenty-one/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guest-twenty-one/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guest-twenty-one/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guest-twenty-one/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guest-twenty-one/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-11-16T06:32:18Z","updated_at":"2022-11-16T06:32:18Z","body":"Also, it seems there's a fundamental flaw with the eviction queue implementation:\r\n\r\n- if `FontAtlasSet` is full, the oldest `FontAtlas` from the queue is picked for removal\r\n- whether that `FontAtlas` is still being used or not by another `Text` node is not taken into consideration at all\r\n- if it happens that another `Text` node is still using it, the application will panic (the same panic as in the 2nd example above)\r\n\r\nThis makes usage of `TextSettings` with `allow_dynamic_font_size: true` with the current implementation completely unpredictable and should probably be avoided.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/1316446939/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"guest-twenty-one","id":6897121,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4OTcxMjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6897121?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guest-twenty-one","html_url":"https://github.com/guest-twenty-one","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guest-twenty-one/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/user